From: NRO TLS PQC <noreply@openshift-kni>
Subject: [PATCH] metrics: add optional TLS profile (min version, cipher suites)

Allow deployers (e.g. NRO on OpenShift) to pass cluster TLS profile
via flags or config so the metrics server does not rely on Go defaults.
When not set, behavior is unchanged (backward compatible).

Apply to: github.com/k8stopologyawareschedwg/resource-topology-exporter

---
 pkg/config/cfgdispatch.go   |  2 +
 pkg/config/flags.go         |  4 ++
 pkg/metrics/server/setup.go | 95 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 3 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

